-- auth.flow
-- Permission, confirmation and rate-limit rules.
--
-- PERMISSION is required on every action and resource. Without one, a capability
-- falls through to the PUBLIC default and silently exposes the backend.
--
-- ROLE and OWNER read identity claims from X-AXL-Subject and X-AXL-Roles, and
-- those headers are honoured ONLY when the server runs with
-- --trust-identity-headers. With the flag off, both levels deny every request --
-- deliberately, because AXL never validates the bearer token, so an unguarded
-- header gate would be decoration rather than a control.

-- Public: browsing and sign-up need no session.
PERMISSION search_hotels    : PUBLIC
PERMISSION list_rooms       : PUBLIC
PERMISSION register         : PUBLIC
PERMISSION featured_hotels  : PUBLIC

-- Authenticated: any signed-in guest.
PERMISSION create_booking     : AUTH
PERMISSION charge_booking     : AUTH
PERMISSION reserve_inventory  : AUTH
PERMISSION send_confirmation  : AUTH
PERMISSION cancel_booking     : AUTH
PERMISSION my_bookings        : AUTH

-- Staff only. Requires --trust-identity-headers and a gateway that overwrites
-- X-AXL-Roles on every request.
PERMISSION refund_booking : ROLE staff
PERMISSION close_hotel    : ROLE admin

-- Owner-scoped. The caller's verified subject must equal the user_id argument.
-- Note what this does NOT promise: it cannot assert the caller owns some other
-- record, because that needs a backend lookup.
PERMISSION update_profile : OWNER user_id

-- Two-phase commit. The action returns a confirmation envelope instead of
-- executing; the caller must present the OTP to POST /confirm before anything
-- reaches the backend.
CONFIRM cancel_booking : OTP
CONFIRM refund_booking : OTP
CONFIRM close_hotel    : OTP

-- Rate limits. Units are sec, min, hr and day -- and only those four. Any other
-- spelling compiles without a diagnostic and applies no limit at all, so every
-- PUBLIC capability below is worth verifying by actually exceeding it.
RATE_LIMIT search_hotels   : 60/min
RATE_LIMIT list_rooms      : 60/min
RATE_LIMIT register        : 5/hr
RATE_LIMIT featured_hotels : 120/min
RATE_LIMIT create_booking  : 20/min
RATE_LIMIT refund_booking  : 10/day
